  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>P</mtext><mo>-</mo><mtext>V</mtext></math>&nbsp;plots for two gases during adiabatic processes are shown in the figure. Plots <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math> should correspond respectively to<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0020_769cca7e9be1.jpg\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 179px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mtext>He</mtext></mrow></math>and <math> <mrow>  <msub>   <mtext>O</mtext>   <mtext>2</mtext>  </msub>  </mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
